{"completed": true, "response": "{\"better\":\"X\",\"regress\":\"有。X在S01、S05等短停留段落里，未分时出现的感受仍偏密，扫读不如Y轻松；Y有些心理动机也交代得更直接。\",\"nets\":{\"scan\":\"Y\",\"point\":\"X\",\"why\":\"Y\",\"whole\":\"X\",\"fine\":\"X\"},\"why\":\"X的放大高亮让我不用读完所有文字，也能抓到每段的关键转折；感受随音乐逐步出现，更容易把靠近、克制、害怕失去和最终不再隐藏串成同一段经历。它的身体感觉、声音变化和甜蜜中夹着不安的细节，比Y右侧相对零散的短词更具体，也更能跟着音乐体会。Y的完整句子更容易快速读懂，尤其在解释为什么暴露心意会让他不安、为什么后来又想藏回喜欢时，因果关系比X更明白。\"}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "6e7c06e3-ed5a-43a0-9641-bd2c3c8f745e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T025145090867Z", "elapsed_seconds": 108.203, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T02:53:33.294977+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "dd52678ca0d710b8e33f30094ab80f81dda441ee38003acd41c63ff916578359", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"